        "Description": "Good afternoon 47,\ryour primary target is Carlton Smith, a former ICA Agent, who switched sides and now has dangerous intel about the ICA in his hands. Before eliminating Smith, you will also need to eliminate the director of the hospital: Akira Nakamura and the head of the hospital&apos;s morgue: Katashi Ito (Nickname: The curator). Both of them are in our way, if we want to reach Smith, so you need to take care of them aswell. \rGood Luck 47.",
